+        <p class="hero-deck">Confidential, personalized specialty care for men—guided by a surgeon-scientist and delivered in two Manhattan offices.</p>
+        <div class="hero-actions">
+          <a class="button" href="https://sohomenshealth.com/appointments/">Request an appointment <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
