          {
            "target": [
              ".room-featured > p"
            ],
            "html": "<p>Penis, prostate, pelvic floor and anal health.</p>",
            "summary": "Fix any of the following:\n  Element has insufficient color contrast of 3.98 (foreground color: #f5f0e7, background color: #697b6b, font size: 10.5pt (14px), font weight: normal). Expected contrast ratio of 4.5:1"
          },
          {
            "target": [
