+
+        <article class="directory-room directory-room-wide" id="sexual-reproductive" data-category="sexual">
+          <header><span>02</span><div><p>Sexual &amp; reproductive health</p><h2>Private concerns, specialist care</h2></div></header>
+          <div class="service-columns">
+            <div><h3>Penis health</h3><ul><li>Penis Health Overview</li><li>Erectile Dysfunction</li><li>Peyronie’s Disease</li><li>Premature Ejaculation</li><li>P-Shot (PRP Injection to Penis)</li><li>Penis Botox</li><li>Shockwave Therapy to Penis</li><li>Xiaflex Injection Therapy for Peyronie’s Disease</li><li>Trimix Injection Therapy for Erectile Dysfunction</li></ul></div>
+            <div><h3>Prostate &amp; pelvic floor</h3><ul><li>Benign Prostate Hyperplasia (BPH)</li><li>Inflammation (Prostatitis)</li><li>Prostate Cancer</li><li>Pelvic Floor Dysfunction Overview</li><li>Urinary Incontinence</li><li>Pelvic Pain</li><li>Pelvic Floor Rehabilitation</li></ul></div>
+            <div><h3>Anal health</h3><ul><li>Anal Diseases</li><li>Anal Fissure (Tear)</li><li>Anal Abscess and Fistula</li><li>Anal Incontinence</li><li>Anal Warts</li><li>Anal Skin Tags</li><li>Anal Cancer Screening, Pap Smear</li><li>Anorectal Health Overview</li><li>Anorectal Health</li></ul></div>
+          </div>
+          <a class="text-link" href="https://sohomenshealth.com/services/sexual-reproductive-health/">Explore sexual &amp; reproductive health <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
