+
+        <article class="directory-room" id="surgical" data-category="surgical">
+          <header><span>03</span><div><p>Physician-led specialty care</p><h2>Surgical diseases</h2></div></header>
+          <p class="directory-note">The live practice groups surgical diseases as a principal service area. Consult the practice for the condition-specific pathway.</p>
