+      <div class="visit-copy">
+        <p class="eyebrow">A confidential &amp; personalized experience</p>
+        <h2 id="visit-title">A visit with room<br><em>to be heard.</em></h2>
+        <p>Your overall health, vitality and wellness are the goals. Your comfort and privacy are priorities. The live practice describes relaxing, private, state-of-the-art offices and personalized care.</p>
+        <ol class="visit-list">
