+  <title>SoHo Men's Health | Confidential Men's Health Care in NYC</title>
+  <meta name="description" content="Confidential, personalized men's health care with Dr. Kerem H. Bortecen in two Manhattan locations. Explore services or request an appointment.">
+  <link rel="canonical" href="https://sohomenshealth.com/">
