+# Final report
+
+## Preview and repository
+
+From this directory, run:
+
+```sh
+python3 -m http.server 4173
+```
+
+Then open `http://127.0.0.1:4173/` for the homepage and `http://127.0.0.1:4173/services.html` for the service directory.
+
